---
import Section from '../layout/Section.astro';
import Container from '../layout/Container.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../ui/SectionHeading.astro';
---
<Section surface="ivory" spacing="md" labelledby="why-heading">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid items-start gap-8 border-t border-rule pt-[clamp(48px,6vw,80px)] lg:grid-cols-[minmax(280px,0.85fr)_1.6fr] lg:gap-[clamp(32px,5vw,88px)]">
      <SectionHeading id="why-heading" eyebrow="Why Marlbridge" font="display">
        Education should meet the learner where they are.
      </SectionHeading>
      <div class="flex max-w-[62ch] flex-col gap-[22px] text-[17.5px] leading-[1.7]">
        <p class="m-0">Marlbridge exists because good teaching and good study material should not depend on where a student happens to live. The curriculum is international; the support around it rarely is.</p>
        <p class="m-0">We are building two things in parallel: teaching that adapts to the individual learner, and an open library of study material that anyone preparing for an examination can use. The first is delivered through our academy and tutoring; the second is published here, free to read.</p>
        <p class="m-0">The work is deliberately unhurried. We would rather publish fifty resources a teacher would recommend than five hundred nobody reads.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Section>
